WEBVTT

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:42.653
Wait! Shirts!

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:45.198
Shirts! Shirts!

00:02:45.899 --> 00:02:48.493
Ohh... Would you
cut it out, Orson?!

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:54.768
It's hard for everyone! Can't
you just shut up and walk?!

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:59.139
Why don't we rest a bit?

00:02:59.212 --> 00:03:00.407
But...

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:04.246
| think we're within striking
distance of Ashram. Besides...

00:03:06.486 --> 00:03:10.684
A forced march this long is
draining everyone's strength.

00:03:10.757 --> 00:03:12.987
Even if we caught up with Ashram...

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:15.926
...we couldn't beat him
in the condition we're in.

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:19.795
You're right. Everyone!
Let's rest for a while!

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:38.542
Say, Parn.

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:41.248
Orson...

00:03:41.321 --> 00:03:44.256
Why do you suppose his
emotions suddenly came back?

00:03:44.857 --> 00:03:49.192
I don't know. But I think |
preferred him the way he was before.

00:03:49.929 --> 00:03:52.899
He's been without
feelings for a long time.

00:03:52.966 --> 00:03:56.129
He doesn't know how
to deal with having them.

00:03:56.803 --> 00:03:59.465
So, that's why-- Shirts!

00:04:01.207 --> 00:04:04.142
Ohh... Parn, can you do
something about this guy?!

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:06.235
We're not gonna be
able to fight at this rate!

00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:09.475
But Shirts, fighting scares me!

00:04:09.849 --> 00:04:12.819
So then why did you
come along with us?

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:14.011
Because I love you!

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:18.984
Wh- What did you just say?!

00:04:19.058 --> 00:04:24.053
I'm not lying! Ever since the spirit
of anger had control of my heart...

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:28.089
...somewhere in those feelings
buried inside me, I loved you.

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:30.659
Now I'm able to see that clearly.

00:04:33.406 --> 00:04:36.034
Orson, please. Won't you tell us?

00:04:36.109 --> 00:04:38.771
Why did your feelings
just suddenly return?

00:04:38.845 --> 00:04:41.143
I think it has to do with
what happened before.

00:04:41.481 --> 00:04:43.449
When I was fighting with Ashram...

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:45.678
...and was hit with the
demon sword, Soul Crusher.

00:04:45.752 --> 00:04:47.311
When he did,
the power hidden inside it...

00:04:47.387 --> 00:04:48.877
...began to flow through my body.

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:53.190
And when I was exposed to Abram's
roar on Blue Dragon Island...

00:04:53.259 --> 00:04:56.251
...the spirit's control over
my heart got even weaker.

00:04:58.564 --> 00:05:03.968
| think that's let me resist
the spirit's control over my heart.

00:05:04.037 --> 00:05:08.531
| see. Ashram's demon
sword and the dragon's roar...

00:05:08.608 --> 00:05:12.511
...have a direct effect
on spirits of the mind.

00:05:12.578 --> 00:05:15.912
But what about
the spirit of anger?

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:18.178
Has it fled
Orson's heart for good?

00:05:18.251 --> 00:05:20.845
No, it's still there.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:24.857
It's lost the power to
control my heart, though.

00:05:24.924 --> 00:05:26.517
It's not just me.

00:05:26.592 --> 00:05:30.028
The spirit of anger exists
in everybody's heart as well.

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:33.259
But as long as you can
restrain it with reason...

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:35.358
...there's no need to get angry.

00:05:35.435 --> 00:05:39.804
Orson! I'm really glad you got
your feelings back and everything.

00:05:39.872 --> 00:05:44.139
But even after what you said,
the one I'm in love with is Parn!

00:05:45.578 --> 00:05:46.409
Shirts!

00:05:46.813 --> 00:05:49.282
Shirts, that's not true!

00:05:49.349 --> 00:05:52.341
You still don't
really know what love is.

00:05:52.685 --> 00:05:55.245
You're just fooling yourself by
replacing your anger about...

00:05:55.321 --> 00:05:57.449
...Parn beating you with
the idea that you love him.

00:05:58.124 --> 00:06:03.290
How angry you were about losing to
Ashram's lady warrior proves that.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:08.390
Losing to her meant that you're
still a "little girl" somehow.

00:06:08.468 --> 00:06:10.937
But for you it's okay
to lose to a man...

00:06:11.037 --> 00:06:13.131
...as long as you're in love
with him.

00:06:17.577 --> 00:06:21.070
Getting your feelings back gave you
insight into other people's hearts?!

00:06:21.147 --> 00:06:22.444
Give me a break!

00:06:22.515 --> 00:06:25.507
What could you
possibly know about me?!

00:06:25.585 --> 00:06:28.520
I am honestly in love with Parn!

00:06:28.588 --> 00:06:31.489
Don't link that with how bad |
felt losing to that Amazon before!

00:06:32.091 --> 00:06:34.423
I'm sorry... I said too much.

00:06:52.712 --> 00:06:54.407
Sir Ashram!

00:06:55.815 --> 00:06:57.374
No doubt about it.

00:06:57.450 --> 00:07:00.078
This is definitely the
way into the volcano.

00:07:00.153 --> 00:07:01.314
I see.

00:07:01.387 --> 00:07:03.583
Wait a moment, Sir Ashram.

00:07:03.656 --> 00:07:04.646
What is it?

00:07:04.724 --> 00:07:07.591
You've seen it yourself.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:12.222
Shooting Star goes away for days
at a time when he hunts for food.

00:07:12.298 --> 00:07:15.563
So, why don't we
go in when he leaves?

00:07:15.635 --> 00:07:19.128
In that case, we can get the
Scepter of Domination easily.

00:07:19.372 --> 00:07:20.999
That's right.

00:07:21.073 --> 00:07:24.338
It's dangerous to fight dragons
when they're fully active.

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:28.040
And there is no righteousness
in fighting unnecessary battles.

00:07:28.114 --> 00:07:30.913
| somehow doubt it will work, but...

00:07:30.983 --> 00:07:33.315
Groder! You and
Smeddy stand guard!

00:07:33.386 --> 00:07:34.547
Sir!

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:37.521
The rest of us will wait for the
beast to leave his nest.

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:38.250
Is that clear?

00:08:05.485 --> 00:08:06.350
What's wrong?

00:08:06.419 --> 00:08:07.682
Look!

00:08:08.921 --> 00:08:10.355
Shooting Star!

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:13.819
Uh-oh! It's headed for Raiden again!

00:08:14.494 --> 00:08:15.586
Hey! Look!

00:08:18.698 --> 00:08:19.756
It's them!

00:08:20.867 --> 00:08:22.426
That was...!

00:08:23.035 --> 00:08:25.402
Troops from Flaim?!

00:08:25.872 --> 00:08:27.533
They must have followed us.

00:08:27.607 --> 00:08:31.908
No, you can't! Besides,
Shooting Star has left his lair!

00:08:32.078 --> 00:08:34.513
We can't let this
opportunity get away!

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.775
But...

00:08:36.549 --> 00:08:41.248
we'll hold the others off! You and
Priest Hobb should go in, sir!

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:45.223
Get the Scepter of Domination
and become king of all Lodoss!

00:08:45.691 --> 00:08:48.683
Heh, you have a way
with words, Groder...

00:08:48.761 --> 00:08:50.695
Very well. I leave
the rest to you.

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:52.225
Sir!

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.625
Over there! It's them!

00:09:01.541 --> 00:09:04.169
Guess they don't
want us to go any further.

00:09:04.243 --> 00:09:05.608
That's fine with me!

00:09:05.678 --> 00:09:08.909
Look at that! It's those
mercenaries from before!

00:09:08.981 --> 00:09:11.507
But there are a few with
them I don't recognize.

00:09:12.952 --> 00:09:15.182
Wha...?! That grass runner!

00:09:16.088 --> 00:09:17.817
Just watch this, Orson!

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:21.656
I'll show you I'm
stronger than that woman!

00:09:21.727 --> 00:09:23.252
Shirts, don't do it!

00:09:23.329 --> 00:09:25.798
You're still tired from a hard
march through the mountains!

00:09:25.865 --> 00:09:27.856
If you fight her, you can't win!

00:09:27.934 --> 00:09:31.768
I'll be fine! I'll settle this
with her in an instant!

00:09:32.672 --> 00:09:34.003
Shirts...

00:09:38.711 --> 00:09:42.170
Something's wrong. I don't
see Ashram. Could he have...?!

00:09:46.085 --> 00:09:48.281
We won't let you
interfere with Sir Ashram!

00:09:48.354 --> 00:09:50.550
Now, go, my servants!

00:10:07.673 --> 00:10:09.141
Dragon's tooth warriors!

00:10:09.208 --> 00:10:11.609
Highness, Ashram isn't here!

00:10:11.677 --> 00:10:14.271
Yes. I'm afraid he's
already entered the volcano.

00:10:14.347 --> 00:10:15.712
With the dragon gone,

00:10:15.781 --> 00:10:18.876
even a child could grab
the Scepter of Domination!

00:10:18.951 --> 00:10:22.945
We don't have any time! Leave this
to me! You go in, sir!

00:10:23.022 --> 00:10:24.421
Thank you!

00:10:25.858 --> 00:10:26.950
Everyone! Let's go!

00:10:34.367 --> 00:10:35.835
Stop him!

00:10:37.336 --> 00:10:38.770
Out of my way!

00:10:42.575 --> 00:10:43.667
Damn!

00:10:44.844 --> 00:10:48.474
"Falaris, god of darkness!
Give me strength!”

00:10:48.547 --> 00:10:51.744
"We desire your power! Let this
one who moves forward..."

00:10:51.817 --> 00:10:54.343
"..Taste the spell of stone!”

00:10:59.291 --> 00:11:00.417
"Great Marfa!'

00:11:00.493 --> 00:11:04.521
"Return this man's heart and
body to the way they were."

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:07.856
So, that woman is a
priestess of Marfa.

00:11:11.537 --> 00:11:13.130
What's happening?! An earthquake?!

00:11:18.577 --> 00:11:21.012
Uh-oh!
He's summoned a behemoth!

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:22.479
It's the strongest land
elemental there is!

00:11:24.784 --> 00:11:28.311
"I summon thee, Iruuk,
great king of the wind!"

00:11:38.597 --> 00:11:40.292
Let's go, everyone!

00:11:54.647 --> 00:11:56.979
One after another...!

00:12:02.221 --> 00:12:06.180
Where is she?! I figured
she'd come straight to me!

00:12:06.258 --> 00:12:08.317
Shirts, no! Don't fight her!

00:12:08.394 --> 00:12:09.987
Just shut up!

00:12:13.866 --> 00:12:14.731
Shirts, look out!

00:12:18.804 --> 00:12:20.294
Orson...

00:12:31.951 --> 00:12:33.976
I finally found you!

00:12:35.221 --> 00:12:38.122
Well, what do you know? If it isn't
the little girl from before!

00:12:38.691 --> 00:12:40.887
Do you want to take me on again?

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:44.396
| may have been careless before,
but I won't be this time!

00:12:44.463 --> 00:12:48.661
Careless? Heh, don't you mean
you just weren't strong enough?

00:12:49.635 --> 00:12:50.864
SHUT up

00:12:57.910 --> 00:12:59.400
Shirts, no!

00:13:11.657 --> 00:13:15.855
That elf! I didn't think she
could summon the king of the wind!

00:13:15.928 --> 00:13:19.922
If two spirits this powerful clash,
the result will be inevitable!

00:13:21.066 --> 00:13:24.195
If you send your
behemoth to attack Parn...

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:28.229
...Iruuk will cut you down!
You don't dare move!

00:13:37.550 --> 00:13:42.181
I should have studied...
swordsmanship for these situations!

00:13:43.122 --> 00:13:46.114
I didn't think anyone could
cast flame spells so powerfully!

00:13:54.433 --> 00:13:55.423
What?!

00:14:00.706 --> 00:14:03.141
I can't let myself be killed here!

00:14:07.913 --> 00:14:09.540
"Endless darkness, cover me!"

00:14:09.615 --> 00:14:11.777
"Transport me to a place
far from here!"

00:14:15.354 --> 00:14:17.118
He ran away!

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:19.549
Are you all right?

00:14:19.625 --> 00:14:21.616
| was wrong.

00:14:21.694 --> 00:14:26.222
You should have been raised
as a warrior, not a sorcerer.

00:14:29.235 --> 00:14:31.932
Come on!
What's the matter, little girl?!

00:14:32.004 --> 00:14:34.735
You're being a lot
clumsier than before!

00:14:34.807 --> 00:14:36.400
Shut up!

00:14:46.886 --> 00:14:48.980
| won't lose... I won't lose!

00:14:55.027 --> 00:14:57.496
Come on! What happened
to all that spirit?!

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:02.458
"God of Darkness! Shine your dark
light and destroy our enemies!"

00:15:04.436 --> 00:15:09.340
"Marfa, great mother of the earth!
Mother of all who live!"

00:15:09.408 --> 00:15:11.604
"Let light fall upon the land!"

00:15:12.778 --> 00:15:15.304
She broke my spell!
What faith she has! Well, then...

00:15:17.182 --> 00:15:17.944
DIEM!

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:22.146
What?!

00:15:22.454 --> 00:15:25.549
"Marfa! Grant guidance
to this person's soul!"

00:15:29.395 --> 00:15:33.457
"God of Darkness! Bring evil
upon this person's words!"

00:15:33.532 --> 00:15:35.227
"Turn their words of
love to words of hatred!"

00:15:35.301 --> 00:15:37.895
"Let their words of comfort
become unintelligible nonsense!”

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:42.373
"Marfa, give eternal
comfort to this man's soul'

00:15:55.421 --> 00:15:56.752
Shirts!

00:15:57.723 --> 00:15:59.418
Out of my way, dammit!

00:15:59.491 --> 00:16:02.483
Shirts, no! Don't die! Shirts!

00:16:07.032 --> 00:16:08.295
Shirts!

00:16:08.367 --> 00:16:09.528
SHIRIS!

00:16:11.036 --> 00:16:12.526
<i>0- Orson...</i>

00:16:13.472 --> 00:16:16.533
What should I do?
What should I do?!

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:20.611
No! No! Damn it all!

00:16:20.679 --> 00:16:23.671
Can't I protect someone
this important to me?!

00:16:23.749 --> 00:16:25.774
Don't I have the strength
to save her?!

00:16:32.224 --> 00:16:35.216
You... You're Hyuri,
the spirit of anger...

00:16:38.497 --> 00:16:40.898
Hyuri, give me the strength I need!

00:16:41.033 --> 00:16:43.400
Give me the strength to save Shirts!

00:16:45.838 --> 00:16:49.934
Hyuri, please!
Make me a berserker once more!

00:16:51.076 --> 00:16:53.272
I don't want to lose her!

00:16:53.345 --> 00:16:56.713
I don't want to lose
another person I love!

00:16:57.449 --> 00:17:01.317
If I can save Shirts, I don't
care what happens to me!

00:17:02.087 --> 00:17:04.283
80, please, give me the strength!

00:17:37.456 --> 00:17:40.187
Well, now you're finished,
little girl.

00:17:42.961 --> 00:17:48.161
Orson, I'm sorry. It looks like...
you were right..after all...

00:17:51.904 --> 00:17:53.394
Orson!

00:18:05.217 --> 00:18:06.548
What?!

00:18:06.618 --> 00:18:09.610
You idiot...
You were finally cured...

00:18:13.358 --> 00:18:14.257
Damn!

00:18:26.105 --> 00:18:27.539
Orson...

00:18:44.389 --> 00:18:46.153
Im...possible...

00:18:56.535 --> 00:18:58.230
Orson!

00:19:15.754 --> 00:19:17.552
Strike me down.

00:19:22.394 --> 00:19:26.024
Because it's my fault
you're going to die.

00:19:26.098 --> 00:19:28.624
So I'll let the two
of us die together.

00:19:29.067 --> 00:19:30.660
Shirts!

00:19:30.736 --> 00:19:32.966
Shirts, don't!

00:19:33.038 --> 00:19:36.702
Go on!
Strike me down, Orson...

00:19:47.553 --> 00:19:52.548
It's not true.
Orson, say it's not true...

00:19:53.358 --> 00:19:56.453
Weren't the two of us
always going to be together?

00:19:59.064 --> 00:20:02.125
Please, answer me. Please...!

00:20:10.442 --> 00:20:13.434
Orson... Orson...

00:20:15.847 --> 00:20:18.646
ORSON!!

00:20:22.721 --> 00:20:23.950
Welcome...

00:20:24.022 --> 00:20:25.490
...to Lodoss Island!

00:20:25.557 --> 00:20:27.025
And now, what you've
all been waiting for...

00:20:27.092 --> 00:20:28.753
...the second part of the show!

00:20:36.702 --> 00:20:42.197
Hey! Everyone! It looks
like we're totally lost!

00:20:42.274 --> 00:20:44.538
How do we get out
of this dungeon?!

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:47.545
Hm?! Dungeon?!

00:20:47.613 --> 00:20:49.138
What kind of school do
you find in a dungeon?!

00:20:49.214 --> 00:20:51.148
A DANJON (Co-Ed) school!

00:20:51.817 --> 00:20:54.582
Well done, Parn!
Your skill has grown yet again!

00:20:54.653 --> 00:20:56.815
Thank you very much,
Your Highness!

00:20:56.888 --> 00:20:59.050
Just what are you two doing?!

00:21:00.058 --> 00:21:01.287
What are we going to do?!

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:03.488
At this rate, we'll never
get back to the surface!

00:21:03.562 --> 00:21:06.588
But, according to that
information we bought in town...

00:21:06.665 --> 00:21:08.895
...the Scepter of Domination
should be down here!

00:21:09.868 --> 00:21:14.863
There's no way the scepter's
in this boondocks dungeon!

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:17.466
Face it, you got taken!

00:21:18.110 --> 00:21:19.635
Shirts! Look at that!

00:21:19.711 --> 00:21:22.305
Agh! Don't scare me like that!

00:21:22.381 --> 00:21:23.712
Wha... What is this?

00:21:23.782 --> 00:21:26.376
It looks like a treasure chest.
Something's written oniit.

00:21:26.451 --> 00:21:28.510
Don't pop out like that!

00:21:28.587 --> 00:21:31.079
It looks like it's written
in ancient runes...

00:21:31.156 --> 00:21:33.181
Can youread it?

00:21:33.258 --> 00:21:36.284
Parts are worn away
that I can't read, but...

00:21:36.361 --> 00:21:40.264
Shi, something, ee,
no, oh, something, ku.

00:21:40.332 --> 00:21:42.096
SHINAI NO OHKOKU?
(The local kingdom?)

00:21:42.167 --> 00:21:44.101
SHIKAI NO OHCHAKU?
(The chairman's dishonesty?)

00:21:44.169 --> 00:21:46.365
SHIBAI NO OHYAKU?
(The role of king in a play?)

00:21:47.072 --> 00:21:48.437
SHIHAI NO OHSHAKU!
(The Scepter of Domination!)

00:21:48.507 --> 00:21:50.874
No way! It's really here?!

00:21:50.942 --> 00:21:52.876
Come on! Let's open it and see!

00:21:56.515 --> 00:21:59.712
Oh, yuck! This thing's a coffin!

00:21:59.785 --> 00:22:02.083
And look at bow-legged
(0-KYAKU) this guy was.

00:22:02.154 --> 00:22:05.146
But where would the Scepter
of Domination be in here?

00:22:05.424 --> 00:22:07.950
Of course! I get it! I get it!

00:22:08.260 --> 00:22:09.989
SHITAINO O-KYAKU!
(The corpse's bow-legs!)

00:22:10.562 --> 00:22:11.927
Shitai no O-Kyaku!

00:23:39.284 --> 00:23:41.412
Fire Dragon Mountain, the site
of the coming showdown!

00:23:41.486 --> 00:23:44.183
It is there that our
final battle begins!

00:23:44.790 --> 00:23:46.986
Against Kashue, the mercenary king,
and the fire dragon...

00:23:47.058 --> 00:23:49.527
<i>...Ashram's demon sword screams out.</i>

00:23:49.594 --> 00:23:52.029
At the end of this fierce battle...

00:23:52.097 --> 00:23:55.123
...the future of Lodoss will
be decided by the victor!

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:58.226
Next time, on Record of Lodoss War -
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight:

00:23:58.303 --> 00:24:01.238
"The Scepter of Domination...
The Dream of a United Lodoss."
